<view class="page review-page">
  <view class="eyebrow">REVIEW ACCESS</view><view class="title">微信审核账号体验</view>
  <view class="notice">使用隔离的审核样例资料，可分别体验管理员、组部长与普通成员。账号只在指定期限内有效，原微信身份仍由云端校验。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice warn">{{error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{active}}" class="card">
    <view class="section-title">当前角色：{{role === 'admin' ? '管理员' : role === 'leader' ? '组部长' : '普通成员'}}</view>
    <view class="muted small">会话截止：{{expiresAt}}</view>
    <view class="review-role-buttons"><button data-role="admin" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="switchRole">体验管理员</button><button data-role="leader" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="switchRole">体验组部长</button><button data-role="member" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="switchRole">体验普通成员</button></view>
    <button disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="logout">退出审核体验</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:else class="card">
    <view class="field"><view class="field-label">审核用户名</view><input class="input" value="{{username}}" bindinput="username" maxlength="40"/></view>
    <view class="field"><view class="field-label">密码</view><input class="input" type="text" password value="{{password}}" bindinput="password" maxlength="128"/></view>
    <button type="primary" disabled="{{busy || !username || !password}}" bindtap="login">进入审核样例</button>
  </view>
  <view class="muted small review-help">审核选图只用于走通照片授权与记录提交流程，云端不保存所选原图，预览统一显示样例占位图。请勿填写真实个人资料。</view>
</view>
